@FoodOrdering.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5230

### Create a store
POST {{FoodOrdering.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "burger-barn",
  "name": "Burger Barn",
  "email": "hello@burgerbarn.test",
  "phone": "+1-555-0100"
}

### List all stores
GET {{FoodOrdering.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stores
Accept: application/json

### Get a store by slug
GET {{FoodOrdering.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stores/burger-barn
Accept: application/json
